{"title": "Where Your Stop Goes", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Most new traders put their stop in the wrong place. Or skip it.", "Stop guessing where your stop goes. Use the chart instead.", "Nobody tells you a stop can be too tight."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop guessing where your stop goes. Use the chart instead.", "text": "Your stop is misplaced", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Two ways it fails", "vo": "Too tight, and ordinary noise stops you out of a good trade. Too wide, or none at all, and one bad trade can wipe out weeks.", "items": [{"text": "Too tight", "sub": "Noise stops you out", "icon": "warn"}, {"text": "Too wide, or none", "sub": "One trade wipes out weeks", "icon": "cross"}], "cues": [{"say": "Too tight", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "Too wide, or none at all", "do": "item", "i": 1}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Find the level", "show": 90, "vo": "A common rule: place it just beyond the level that proves your idea wrong, like below the last swing low.", "cues": [{"say": "the level that proves your idea wrong", "do": "mark", "i": 88, "label": "A", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "below the last swing low", "do": "line", "price": 37.92, "label": "Stop below", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The low held", "vo": "Here the price pulled back, stayed above that low, and kept climbing.", "cues": [{"say": "stayed above that low", "do": "reveal", "to": 96}, {"say": "kept climbing", "do": "reveal", "to": 102}], "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Wrong idea, small loss", "vo": "And if that low had broken, your idea was wrong, and the loss stays small.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise your stops", "vo": "Practise placing your stops with practice money at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Most new traders put their stop in the wrong place. Or skip it.\n\nToo tight, an